  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Shield Bash: once on each of your turns, after you hit a creature within 5 feet with a melee weapon while holding a Shield, you're asked whether to bash it: Strength save (DC 8 + your Strength modifier + Proficiency Bonus) or it's pushed 5 feet or knocked Prone (your choice). Interpose Shield: while you hold a Shield, a successful Dexterity save against a half-damage effect means no damage (applied automatically; mark your Reaction as used).</p>",
